      "id": "overview",
      "type": "overview",
      "label": "Überblick",
      "title": "Lesson intro",
      "minutes": 18,
      "learn": [
        "Present endings: <b>-e, -st, -t, -en, -t, -en</b>.",
        "A stem ending in <b>-t</b> or <b>-d</b> takes an extra <b>e</b>: du arbeitest, er arbeitet.",
        "A stem ending in <b>-s, -ss, -ß, -z</b> uses <b>du + -t</b>: du heißt.",
        "In a statement the verb is in <b>position 2</b>."
      ],
      "vocab": [
